desc: Swap these two lines
category: manual
par: 3
hint1: Delete one line, then put it back in the right place
hint2: dd cuts a line into a register; p pastes it below the cursor
solution: ddp
note: dd deletes (cuts) the current line; p puts it back below the next one, swapping the pair.
--- START ---
line two
line one
--- GOAL ---
line one
line two
--- END ---
